# install writes the block after the owner's text
$ runtime install --target claude
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
[claude] install: restart_required — Claude lifecycle hooks installed; restart Claude to load hook changes; owner rules written to <WORLD>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md
--- stderr ---

--- home/.claude/CLAUDE.md ---
<!-- gentle-ai:persona -->
## Rules
<!-- /gentle-ai:persona -->

my own text

<!-- labdrian:owner-rules -->
## Rules

- a rule
- another rule
<!-- /labdrian:owner-rules -->

# status
$ runtime status --target claude
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
[claude] status: supported — Claude lifecycle hooks are installed and owned; owner rules block is current in <WORLD>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md
--- stderr ---

# status after the rules changed
$ runtime status --target claude
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
[claude] status: partial — Claude owner rules block is stale in <WORLD>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md; run 'engine runtime update --target claude'
--- stderr ---

# update replaces the block in place
$ runtime update --target claude
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
[claude] update: restart_required — Claude lifecycle hooks updated; restart Claude to load hook changes; owner rules updated in <WORLD>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md
--- stderr ---

--- home/.claude/CLAUDE.md ---
<!-- gentle-ai:persona -->
## Rules
<!-- /gentle-ai:persona -->

my own text

<!-- labdrian:owner-rules -->
## Rules

- a changed rule
<!-- /labdrian:owner-rules -->

# uninstall removes only the block
$ runtime uninstall --target claude
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
[claude] uninstall: restart_required — Claude lifecycle hooks removed; restart Claude to unload stale hook processes; owner rules removed from <WORLD>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md
--- stderr ---

--- home/.claude/CLAUDE.md ---
<!-- gentle-ai:persona -->
## Rules
<!-- /gentle-ai:persona -->

my own text

# a block without its close marker is not touched
$ runtime install --target claude
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
[claude] install: partial — Claude lifecycle hooks installed; restart Claude to load hook changes; owner rules could not be written: <WORLD>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md: its markers are not one open line followed by one close line
--- stderr ---

--- home/.claude/CLAUDE.md ---
mine
